## Purpose

This harness organizes the revision of `{{PAPER_TITLE}}` so that
reviewer requests, author decisions, manuscript changes, verification
evidence, and approvals remain traceable without being conflated.

It does not decide how a reviewer request should be handled. The author
retains control over mathematical content, scholarly claims, scope, and
final approval.

